      "text": [
        "3673 - وَ قَالَ اَلنَّبِيُّ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ لِرَجُلٍ \"أَصْبَحْتَ صَائِماً\" قَالَ لاَ قَالَ \"فَعُدْتَ مَرِيضاً\" قَالَ لاَ قَالَ \"فَاتَّبَعْتَ جَنَازَةً\" قَالَ لاَ قَالَ \"فَأَطْعَمْتَ مِسْكِيناً\" قَالَ لاَ قَالَ \"فَارْجِعْ إِلَى أَهْلِكَ فَأَصِبْهُمْ فَإِنَّهُ مِنْكَ عَلَيْهِمْ صَدَقَةٌ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3673 - The Prophet (peace be upon him and his family) said to a man:\n\"Did you wake up fasting?\"\nHe replied: \"No.\"\nHe (sw) said: \"Then did you visit a sick person?\"\nHe replied: \"No.\"\nHe (sw) said: \"Then did you follow a funeral procession?\"\nHe replied: \"No.\"\nHe (sw) said: \"Then did you feed a poor person?\"\nHe replied: \"No.\"\nHe (sw) said: \"Then return to your family and be with them, for that is a charity from you to them.\""
        ]
      }
    },
